PART 6 — HAND IK, GRIP SYSTEM AND OBJECT ATTACHMENTS

THIS IS ONE OF THE MOST IMPORTANT CHARACTER FIXES.

The character's hands currently do not properly connect with held objects.

Sometimes the hands penetrate the object.

Sometimes the hands are too far away.

Sometimes the grip looks disconnected.

Rebuild the hand interaction system.

